# Runtime credentials consumed by agent-secret-broker service identities.
# This file is an operator manifest, not a daily-shell .env file. Values are
# read from the selected provider and written directly to root-owned,
# per-consumer credential files by bin/vault-provision.
#
# GitHub PATs and SERPER are intentionally absent. GitHub uses a
# repository-scoped App installation; store its PEM private key with literal
# \n escapes when the provider cannot preserve multiline values.
CONTEXT7_API_KEY=
TAVILY_API_KEY=
TODOIST_API_KEY=
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY=
